-- en: "Matches when the game offers Blizzard's Assisted Combat for your character and current specialization. When it does not (for example a specialization Blizzard has no Assisted Combat rotation for, or a client that declares the API but does not offer the feature), this is false, so a branch can fall back to your own steps."
L["Matches when the game offers Blizzard's Assisted Combat for your character and current specialization. When it does not (for example a specialization Blizzard has no Assisted Combat rotation for, or a client that declares the API but does not offer the feature), this is false, so a branch can fall back to your own steps."] = "게임이 내 캐릭터와 현재 전문화에 Blizzard의 전투 보조를 제공할 때 일치합니다. 제공하지 않을 때(예: Blizzard에 전투 보조 로테이션이 없는 전문화, 또는 API는 선언하지만 기능을 제공하지 않는 클라이언트)는 거짓이므로, 분기에서 내 단계로 대체할 수 있습니다."
